-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Scope of this licence
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The MIT licence above covers the source code written by the team: src/, tools/,
tests/, netlify/, index.html, vite.config.js and the build/config files.

Content (content/: rulings, story script, UI strings, source log) and the
documentation written by the team (docs/) are licensed under
Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International
(CC BY-NC-SA 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/
Copyright (c) 2026 Yawmuk team (Lemonada).

The rulings are AI-prepared drafts pending scholarly review; they are an
educational aid, not a fatwa.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party material (not covered by the licences above)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

- Quran text and translation: quoted verbatim for reference with a link to the
  source of each verse (quran.com / Tanzil / QuranEnc - Saheeh International).
  They remain under their publishers' terms.
- Hadith texts: quoted verbatim with collection, number and grade, linking to
  sunnah.com, dorar.net and the hadith-api data set; they remain under their
  publishers' terms.
- 3D assets in public/assets/: 242 CC0 1.0 assets (Kenney, Poly Haven,
  Quaternius and other poly.pizza authors) and 11 CC-BY 3.0 models that require
  attribution. Each asset's author, source URL and licence is in
  public/assets/catalog.json and public/assets/LICENSES.md; the CC-BY credits
  are shown in the in-game Credits screen.
- Animated characters in public/assets/characters/: Quaternius, CC0 1.0
  (public/assets/characters/LICENSES.md).
- Fonts (Amiri, Amiri Quran, IBM Plex Sans Arabic, Reem Kufi), loaded from
  Google Fonts: SIL Open Font License 1.1.
- npm dependencies keep their own licences: three (MIT), postprocessing (Zlib),
  n8ao (ISC), @anthropic-ai/sdk (MIT); development only: vite (MIT),
  puppeteer-core (Apache-2.0), @gltf-transform/* (MIT), meshoptimizer (MIT).
  See node_modules/<package>/LICENSE.
